    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473810/extras/1f041468c83aa9346883141b1eebe2a8.avif?t=1748941163\" data-has-big width=800 height=134 /></span>&quot;MINDFALL&quot; is an intense psychological horror game that delves into the depths of the human mind and its struggle with the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young man who faces financial difficulties after an unexpected layoff from his job. In a desperate attempt to find a source of income, he takes a night shift as a security guard at an abandoned underground parking lot. At first glance, it seems like a simple job, but the atmosphere of the place causes him strange unease.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473810/extras/49369e3586df2475884cfc61aeddb12b.poster.avif?t=1748941163\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473810/extras/49369e3586df2475884cfc61aeddb12b.webm?t=1748941163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473810/extras/49369e3586df2475884cfc61aeddb12b.mp4?t=1748941163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the first moments of the shift, you sense that this place is not as harmless as it seems. Dim light, endless concrete corridors, and the distant echo of your footsteps create a feeling of isolation. But gradually, this feeling grows into something more \u2014 shadows begin to move, sounds emanate from places where no one could be, and it seems that someone is watching you from the darkness.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473810/extras/2d08f2bd30102bc008bb8f6ec64087e3.poster.avif?t=1748941163\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473810/extras/2d08f2bd30102bc008bb8f6ec64087e3.webm?t=1748941163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473810/extras/2d08f2bd30102bc008bb8f6ec64087e3.mp4?t=1748941163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must immerse themselves in a grim story where reality intertwines with illusions. You need to explore the parking lot, collect clues, and try to understand: is this a product of imagination, caused by moral decline, or a real threat from which there is no escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to survive this night and uncover the mystery hidden behind the concrete walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grim and gripping storyline:</strong> immerse yourself in a psychological nightmare where reality and illusions intertwine, and every decision you make can be decisive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning graphics:</strong> every corner of the abandoned parking lot, every creak and rustle is meticulously detailed to create a sense of total isolation and unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgettable atmosphere:</strong> the sound design, filled with echoes of footsteps, rustling, and unseen threats, will raise the tension to its peak, making your heart race with every moment.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473810/extras/1f041468c83aa9346883141b1eebe2a8.avif?t=1748941163\" data-has-big width=800 height=134 /></span>&quot;MINDFALL&quot; is an intense psychological horror game that delves into the depths of the human mind and its struggle with the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young man who faces financial difficulties after an unexpected layoff from his job. In a desperate attempt to find a source of income, he takes a night shift as a security guard at an abandoned underground parking lot. At first glance, it seems like a simple job, but the atmosphere of the place causes him strange unease.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473810/extras/49369e3586df2475884cfc61aeddb12b.poster.avif?t=1748941163\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473810/extras/49369e3586df2475884cfc61aeddb12b.webm?t=1748941163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473810/extras/49369e3586df2475884cfc61aeddb12b.mp4?t=1748941163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the first moments of the shift, you sense that this place is not as harmless as it seems. Dim light, endless concrete corridors, and the distant echo of your footsteps create a feeling of isolation. But gradually, this feeling grows into something more \u2014 shadows begin to move, sounds emanate from places where no one could be, and it seems that someone is watching you from the darkness.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473810/extras/2d08f2bd30102bc008bb8f6ec64087e3.poster.avif?t=1748941163\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473810/extras/2d08f2bd30102bc008bb8f6ec64087e3.webm?t=1748941163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473810/extras/2d08f2bd30102bc008bb8f6ec64087e3.mp4?t=1748941163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must immerse themselves in a grim story where reality intertwines with illusions. You need to explore the parking lot, collect clues, and try to understand: is this a product of imagination, caused by moral decline, or a real threat from which there is no escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to survive this night and uncover the mystery hidden behind the concrete walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grim and gripping storyline:</strong> immerse yourself in a psychological nightmare where reality and illusions intertwine, and every decision you make can be decisive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning graphics:</strong> every corner of the abandoned parking lot, every creak and rustle is meticulously detailed to create a sense of total isolation and unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgettable atmosphere:</strong> the sound design, filled with echoes of footsteps, rustling, and unseen threats, will raise the tension to its peak, making your heart race with every moment.</p></li></ul>",
